@startuml
!include style.iuml
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowFontSize 14
' Auto-save and crash recovery (Module 6): ViewModels/ExamSessionViewModel (OnAnswerEdited; SyncTickAsync every 1 s:
' AutosaveScheduler.TakeDue -> SendAsync -> SendPendingAsync, then FlushOfflineAsync when the 5 s OfflineRetryDelay has passed,
' then WriteBackupIfDirty; SaveAnswerAsync on question change / focus lost; RestoreAnswersAsync).
' Services/ApiClient.SaveAnswerAsync -> OfflineSaveQueue.Classify: 2xx Accepted, 409 STALE_REVISION Stale, no reply / 401 / 408 /
' 429 / 5xx Offline (queued), anything else Rejected (status "Not saved: ..."; dropped from the queue, kept in the local backup).
' ExamsController.SaveAnswer: 404 not own session; 400 TimeOverMessage when TimedOut or SubmissionService.IsClosed(session, now)
' (exam end + ExtraMinutes + 2 min DeadlineGrace, server clock); 400 when not InProgress; 409 STALE_REVISION.
' Core/Submission/OfflineSaveQueue (newest revision per answer, FlushAsync oldest first, stops at the first Offline),
' Core/Backup/AnswerBackupStore (AES-256-GCM, key wrapped by DPAPI; Load -> BackupLoadResult Ok / Missing / Tampered),
' AnswerMerge (higher revision wins; with a tampered backup only the server copy is merged; a backup of another user/exam is ignored).
' Relaunch: DashboardViewModel.StartExamAsync -> POST /api/exams/student/start returns the InProgress session.
hide footbox
hide unlinked
skinparam ParticipantPadding 2
skinparam BoxPadding 0
skinparam sequence {
  MessageAlign left
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #E6E6E6
}

actor Student
participant "ExamSession\nViewModel" as VM
participant "Answer\nBackupStore" as BS
participant "Offline\nSaveQueue" as Q
participant "ApiClient" as API
participant "Exams\nController" as EC

Student ->> VM : edit answer\n(revision + 1)
loop every 1 s
  [->> VM : timer tick
  activate VM
  opt save due (10 s after the first unsaved edit,\nor at once on question change\nor window focus loss)
    VM -> API : save answer
    activate API
    API -> EC : POST save-answer
    activate EC
    alt session in progress, before the deadline
      EC --> API : saved, or stale
      API --> VM : Accepted / Stale
    else deadline passed or not in progress
      EC --> API : refused
      deactivate EC
      API --> VM : "Not saved";\nkept in local backup
    else no reply or temporary error
      API --> VM : Offline
      deactivate API
      VM -> Q : queue newest revision
    end
  end
  opt queue not empty, 5 s since last try
    VM -> Q : flush
    activate Q
    Q --> VM : sent oldest first;\nstops at first Offline
    deactivate Q
  end
  VM -> BS : write encrypted\nbackup if changed
  deactivate VM
end
@enduml
